<title>UK: Credit Suisse adds 250 mln SFR to 10-year bond.</title>
<headline>Credit Suisse adds 250 mln SFR to 10-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond has been increased to 750 million Swiss francs from 500 million Swiss francs, lead manager CSFB said.</p>
<p> BORROWER   CS HOLDING</p>
<p> AMT    750 MLN SFR  COUPON     4.0    MATURITY   23.MAY.07</p>
<p> TYPE   STRAIGHT ISS PRICE  101.625   PAY DATE    23.MAY.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  =	  LISTING    EBS   EOS	   07.MAY.97</p>
<p> MOODY	A1	 S&amp;P	  AA-   DENOMS (K)  FIVE</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7748</p>
</text>
